      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好想表现出战斗者的优美和力量……\n还有那虚无缥缈的感觉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
